  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57a8e05a8a1d4451e9081ab70ab1f576, type: 3}
  itemDescription: Refining and Petrochemical Technologies Institute  This institute
    serves the oil refining and petrochemical sector by researching process innovations
    and new products. Its mission is to improve refinery processes (catalysts, efficiency,
    emissions reduction) and develop value-added petrochemical technologies (new
    polymers, plastics, specialty chemicals). Focus areas include catalyst development
    for refining (e.g. to produce cleaner fuels or maximize output of desired products),
    process optimization via modeling and AI, and conversion of oil/gas into petrochemical
    feedstocks more efficiently. The institute also explores sustainable petrochemical
    routes, such as recycling plastics into feedstock (aligning with circular carbon
    initiatives). By advancing refining and petrochemical tech, it helps Saudi industries
    remain competitive and move toward more advanced, diversified chemical products
  description: 
  isRocketPart: 0
